      "message": "If not for multitree, I suspect that this would have been converted to cc_library_headers - Liz, correct me if I\u0027m wrong. I think having two rules is confusing. How does one decide when to use which?\n\nCan you describe a brief plan to converge the two (if it makes sense)? Should we move all cc_library_headers to cc_api_headers? Should cc_api_headers be just a macro that wrap cc_library_headers? ",
